{"id":"93363155-fdb3-41ec-afbf-9164a42f204f","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"85679a095d43164c","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/editor-metrics.ts","baseline":{"blob":"76dbd8ed23459569c0da9ef73b37d0271402d0a5","start":2182,"end":2217},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","SUPERBLOCK_MAGIC","=","0x","62732E7A"]},"context":{"before":"23079c9bb8d390e6","after":"328e5047f5670943"}},"payload":{"text":"zen-fs SingleBuffer's (version 2's) superblock, little-endian: magic (u32 at 4), version (u16 at 8), block_size (u32 at\n20), total_bytes (u64 at 24), state_offset (u32 at 48). Its state: generation (u64 at 8), then two commits of 60 bytes\nfrom 24 — the current one `generation & 1` — each with free_bytes, spare_total and pending_bytes (u32s at 32, 44\nand 56). What's free is what SingleBufferStore.usage() says: free_bytes + spare_total × block_size + pending_bytes.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:52:50.441Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:52:50.441Z"}
